WEBVTT

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:16.180
Come in.

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:21.580
How do you feel?

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:29.720
I finally found the melody of Aquarion.

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:32.820
The perfect melody I've been searching for.

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:35.130
Just a little more...

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:37.280
Don't push yourself.

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:39.340
Shrade, you know that your body—

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:40.140
I don't care.

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:44.100
I have to play that melody with my own hands.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.700
Let the fiery depths of Hell take my body.

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:54.030
This is a special permission waiver.

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:59.700
But this quest of yours can only end in death.

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:03.120
Keep that in mind.

00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:11.800
We can only hear the melody of life because death comes with it.

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:51.190
Are you satisfied, my classmates?

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:54.190
It has been one full week since the Berlin fell,

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:58.440
yet we men and women are still separated by unseen walls!

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:03.450
We must tear down the walls between us and share ourselves with one another!

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:05.640
What's going on?

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:08.790
Dunno, he just got up there and started making some dumb speech.

00:03:09.110 --> 00:03:11.400
Andy, I think that's enough—

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:12.290
Fool!

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:16.500
My classmates, I motion for an emergency seating change!

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.200
All this just to switch seats?

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:19.470
Objection!

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:21.500
Changing seats is out of the question!

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:24.850
If men and women mix any further,
the taint will be impossible to cleanse!

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:26.300
Changing seats?

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:27.720
I like it.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:28.600
I second that!

00:03:29.630 --> 00:03:33.080
This'll be fun! I call next to Cayenne!

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:33.920
Why, you...

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:35.480
I think it's going well.

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:37.280
You're all impure!

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:39.490
Unclean! Tainted!

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:41.440
So how do we pick seats?

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:43.240
I guess we can draw for it.

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:47.620
I'll draw for Cayenne and Shrade, since they're out!

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:05.780
It's all sunshine and holes...

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:08.900
I mean roses for me from here on!

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:14.820
My name's Malloy. Nice to meet you.

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:17.020
You were in the mock battle!

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:18.820
My name's Ei Chan. It's a pleasure.

00:04:19.550 --> 00:04:20.740
Really?

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:21.820
I know, right?

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:24.120
Why me?

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:30.340
Why him, of all people...?

00:04:31.550 --> 00:04:32.580
Those big bangs...

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:36.840
Huh?

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:39.360
Hi, Amata!

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:40.710
H-Hi.

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:42.630
Hey!

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:45.290
Looks like it's going to get hot around here.

00:04:45.290 --> 00:04:47.850
And I don't mean in combat.

00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:51.520
Let me down!

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:53.360
Amata!

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:02.980
Cayenne and Shrade are sitting next to each other!

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:06.060
This must be a gift from God!

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:09.200
Ooh, I just can't stand it!

00:05:11.070 --> 00:05:13.560
This is the first time we've sat by each other, isn't it?

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:15.120
And the last, if I can help it.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:18.380
Thanks for coming for me, my friend.

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:20.660
I didn't come to get you.

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:23.040
I was investigating the Abductors, and while I was here—

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:23.590
Eyes on the road.

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:28.740
What's the matter?

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:30.510
Your sound is clumsy and depressed.

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:31.970
Shut it!

00:05:33.130 --> 00:05:35.320
I was making a joke, my friend.

00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:44.440
Damn it! Why does everyone look so happy?

00:05:44.810 --> 00:05:49.820
And who just left this cat doll here, anyway?

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:52.700
A doll, huh? I got it!

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:55.710
Gah! There it is!

00:05:56.090 --> 00:05:57.860
The doll of dread, right here with us!

00:05:57.860 --> 00:05:58.710
What?

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:00.260
What's going on?

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:01.710
What about the doll?

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:03.550
Have you heard the story?

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:08.010
It's about an Element who disappeared in Neo-Deava.

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:09.120
What are you talking about?

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:11.600
It happened a few years ago...

00:06:12.230 --> 00:06:15.560
A girl transferred into the Academy.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:21.810
But she was timid and shy, and couldn't make any friends.

00:06:22.970 --> 00:06:26.990
Finally, she couldn't stand to be alone,

00:06:27.390 --> 00:06:30.460
and one day, she vanished from the Academy.

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:35.690
You mean, she...

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:37.460
She must have been so sad...

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:41.380
The girl had just one friend, her doll.

00:06:41.970 --> 00:06:48.170
The doll appears at night, wandering around campus.

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:53.020
Sometimes, you can hear its sad, lonely voice,

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:56.560
singing of the girl's tragedy...

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:58.890
That's stupid.

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:01.310
I've actually heard that story.

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:05.140
Ever since the Berlin fell, that doll has
even been spotted in the boys' dorms.

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:07.280
Malloy believes it, too!

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:08.490
It must be true!

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:11.060
No! I'm scared!

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:12.320
Gah!

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:14.820
The doll just moved!

00:07:14.820 --> 00:07:15.740
Andy!

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:18.140
Will you cut the crap already?

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:22.180
I mean it! It actually moved!

00:07:35.690 --> 00:07:37.810
Mission complete.

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:40.080
Well done, Jin.

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:41.060
Thanks.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:47.070
But you know, the simulation is to prepare you for real combat.

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:48.540
How's Kagura?

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:51.320
This time, he's not getting out for a while.

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:55.300
An invisible door, a door to the future.

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:57.920
Fly to the end of the world.

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:04.820
I'm gonna check what's on the other side of the door again.

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:05.710
Go ahead.

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:09.280
Last son of Altair...

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:23.280
Finally done.

00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:30.780
Hey, uh... Zessica?

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:32.920
Evening! You on cleaning duty?

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:35.070
I was just heading back.

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:37.740
Really? What a coincidence!

00:08:38.090 --> 00:08:40.040
I'm going back to my dorm, too!

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:40.980
Huh.

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:43.440
Let's walk together!

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:45.330
Don't be shy!

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:47.460
I'm accompanying you!

00:08:57.110 --> 00:08:57.970
Huh?

00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:01.300
Oh, no! It's locked?

00:09:01.300 --> 00:09:03.350
Guess we have to sneak in.

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:06.470
Well my room's this way, so...

00:09:06.470 --> 00:09:08.230
H-Hey, wait!

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:14.080
Why don't you come in from the girls' side?

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:16.950
Um, okay, but why?

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:31.750
Zessica...

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:35.120
I can't walk with you clinging to me.

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:36.500
I'm sorry!

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:39.760
Hey, are you...

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:42.140
scared?

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.480
Don't be stupid!

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:45.390
There's no way!

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:49.540
I'm not scared of moving dolls or singing ghosts!

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:51.860
They're not even real!

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:53.860
What was that?

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.320
It's that doll!

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:01.500
What is it doing there?

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:12.080
No way!

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:13.940
It's just some stupid story!

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:16.260
It must be someone screwing with us!

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:53.130
You stink deliciously.

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:55.900
I was scared...

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:58.660
but that wasn't all.

00:10:59.330 --> 00:11:02.480
I still can't stop thinking about him.

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.900
Why is that?

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:11.400
Stop grabbing me there!

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:13.940
Don't leave me!

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:20.490
No... not Zessica and Amata...

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:26.240
Get back here, Jin!

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:30.210
Keep your hands off my smelly wench!

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:33.580
Now, let's see...

00:11:34.150 --> 00:11:38.960
if you can lead us to our true Eve.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.470
I really saw it!

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:47.460
What, the cat doll?

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:49.730
Yeah! In the hall, in the middle of the night!

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:51.500
You saw it, too, right, Amata?

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:52.730
Yeah. Definitely.

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:55.240
Dude, it was a joke.

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:56.680
Are you taking it seriously?

00:11:56.680 --> 00:11:58.530
It was your story in the first place!

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:00.580
It was even walking!

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:01.920
And we heard it singing!

00:12:01.920 --> 00:12:02.860
Sure you did.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:06.520
You're at the age where you start seeing things.

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:08.440
You're the same age as us!

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:10.120
I have a more important question.

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:13.750
What were you two doing together so late at night?

00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:16.960
Oh, that? Zessica was—

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:18.740
What?

00:12:18.740 --> 00:12:22.500
Don't tell them I was scared! You're embarrassing me!

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:25.160
What are you two whispering about?

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:26.600
Well, I—

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:29.040
Why can't you tell us?

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:29.970
You're filthy!

00:12:30.490 --> 00:12:33.260
Don't tell me you sullied our holy Academy's grounds by—

00:12:33.260 --> 00:12:35.200
No, we didn't!

00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:36.520
I saw it!

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:39.960
You saw the walking doll?

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:46.160
No, but I saw Zessica and Amata running
across the courtyard in each other's arms!

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:50.160
And Zessica was screaming at Amata, "Don't leave me!"

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:54.020
So they were having a lovers' spat?

00:12:54.020 --> 00:12:55.580
I knew it!

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:57.170
You've got it all wrong!

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.800
Come on, Mikono!

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:03.120
<i>Abductors have been detected in the Neo-Kowloon area!</i>

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:06.420
<i>All Elements: report to phase one battle stations immediately!</i>

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:10.960
<i>Repeat, all Elements: report to phase one battle stations immediately!</i>

00:13:16.110 --> 00:13:18.650
Analysis complete. Pattern B.

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:21.650
Proceeding just like in the simulation.

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:24.860
The Abductor has destroyed all of the walls!

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:26.340
It's moving at 60 kph!

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:31.390
Strange. It's not trying to capture anyone.

00:13:31.390 --> 00:13:33.650
We can't let it do any more damage.

00:13:33.650 --> 00:13:34.540
Zessica, you're the head!

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:35.460
Roger!

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:38.140
You're with Cayenne and Amata. Get going!

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:38.920
Roger!

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:50.640
Mikono's really mad at me.

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:55.060
We don't know the range or accuracy of the enemy's laser fire.

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:56.700
Be careful out there.

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:57.600
Roger!

00:13:59.950 --> 00:14:00.960
We're being ambushed!

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:02.360
But from where?

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:04.920
Its error in accuracy is 0.0003%.

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:10.700
Impossible! He can aim a laser so precisely through the atmosphere?

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:12.870
Radius Gnis.

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:13.490
Fudo?

00:14:14.710 --> 00:14:17.940
He can spot a coin from a thousand villages away,

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:19.980
fire an unerring arrow,

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:22.210
strike true, and pierce straight through!

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:24.880
How do you know that?

00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:28.020
I can see.

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:34.010
Unite now! A Vector wouldn't survive one hit from that!

00:14:34.530 --> 00:14:37.020
Fly low and close in!

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:40.690
Emergency Union! Go, Aquarion!

00:14:47.090 --> 00:14:49.740
Aquarion Gepard!

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:57.880
That area has already been evacuated.

00:14:57.880 --> 00:15:00.000
You're allowed to use the buildings for cover.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:00.960
Roger!

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:03.220
It's still out of our attack range.

00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:04.960
But there's only one!

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:06.510
We'll stay behind cover and close the distance!

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:15.930
I can read your movements like a book.

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:19.640
I'll just overwhelm you and pin you down.

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:24.770
The enemy is releasing small flying objects!

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:25.770
Missiles?

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:27.610
What are those?

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:35.410
No way!

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:40.210
Damn it! Now we're screwed!

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:47.300
Those floating objects are reflecting the lasers!

00:15:47.810 --> 00:15:50.420
The enemy's lasers can attack from all directions!

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:52.730
This is bad.

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:55.260
They can no longer use their surroundings as cover.

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:04.760
It's like we're up against a whole army!

00:16:04.760 --> 00:16:06.360
Zessica! Behind you!

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:11.860
Amata!

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:18.160
Vector Z is taking the brunt of the laser fire!

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:20.370
Amata Sora's spirit level is falling!

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:21.620
Amata!

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:24.210
It's hit the limit! The Union is breaking!

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:30.880
Amata!

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:33.080
This is my fault!

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:36.140
I'm not good enough at controlling Aquarion!

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:38.260
Zessica's spirit level is falling!

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:41.180
It's below 40, now 30%!

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:43.390
But Amata's the one taking damage!

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:45.520
Zessica...

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:49.520
Peoples' hearts cannot be seen with the naked eye.

00:16:49.930 --> 00:16:54.000
And so, they misunderstand one another and drive each other apart.

00:16:54.000 --> 00:17:00.790
However, Mikono Suzushiro, there is a purpose for things unseen.

00:17:02.570 --> 00:17:06.020
Now, we shall find strength in those invisible hearts!

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:07.420
Element Change!

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:11.640
Switch out Zessica Wong for Yunoha Thrul!

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:13.740
Yunoha?

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:14.840
Who's that?

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:27.240
What?

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:28.440
A doll?

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:30.460
Um, uh...

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:32.180
Hello.

00:17:32.180 --> 00:17:33.110
It talked!

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:42.060
Amata, Zessica, I'm really sorry for surprising you last night.

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:44.910
And I'm sorry that Mikono got mad at you because of me.

00:17:45.730 --> 00:17:47.480
It was all just a big misunderstanding.

00:17:47.480 --> 00:17:51.480
If you saw something like that late at night, you'd freak out, too.

00:17:51.480 --> 00:17:52.920
I'm really sorry!

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:57.440
But please, you have to trust me and let me fight with you.

00:17:57.440 --> 00:17:59.430
You're an Element?

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:03.060
Can we do this later?

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:08.280
Amata, will you still... Unite with me?

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:10.860
Yeah. I trust you.

00:18:11.430 --> 00:18:15.940
Spectral Union! Go, Aquarion!

00:18:28.890 --> 00:18:31.160
No! They'll see me!

00:18:31.160 --> 00:18:33.340
They'll all see me!

00:18:34.350 --> 00:18:36.210
I can see her! I can really see her!

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:38.840
So that's what you really look like...

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:44.060
No! I don't want them to see me!

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:46.480
But it feels nice...

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:50.480
Aquarion Evol!

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:54.330
It's the Machine Angel's other form.

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:56.440
This was in the simulation, too.

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.340
It's the student who disappeared!

00:19:00.340 --> 00:19:02.100
She rematerialized!

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:03.580
And she's cute!

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:07.100
Stop looking at me! I...

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:14.090
Did I miss?

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:15.340
What?

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:16.800
Aquarion vanished!

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:22.050
The lasers went right through us!

00:19:22.450 --> 00:19:28.560
Her shyness expands to cover her, making her transparent to light.

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:32.690
That's Yunoha Thrul's Element power.

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:38.570
This is what the soul of a beautifully shy young lady can accomplish.

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:40.900
Be careful.

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:45.460
I can't keep all of Aquarion transparent for very long.

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:46.880
Works for me!

00:19:46.880 --> 00:19:48.440
Yunoha, you're amazing!

00:19:48.440 --> 00:19:53.290
Please, if you compliment me like that, I'll get shy...

00:19:58.410 --> 00:19:59.760
My lasers can't hit it, and it's vanished from all my sensors!

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:02.640
This wasn't in the simulation at all!

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:12.120
We're only 800m from the enemy!

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:14.040
Just keep closing in on him!

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:14.600
Right!

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:19.720
Oh, of course.

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:22.540
You're just invisible to light.

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:25.620
I can't see you, but you're still there.

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:28.260
So I can still shoot you with solid bullets!

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:33.720
Is it gone yet?

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:49.390
I'm getting overwhelmed! Pinned down!

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:50.610
Now!

00:20:50.610 --> 00:20:52.640
Hit him with a fist he can't see!

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:58.840
Subliminal Punch!

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:05.610
We beat him!

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:09.000
They won!

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:10.820
Did the ghost do that?

00:21:21.810 --> 00:21:25.470
I guess that's the best I can do with this transdimensional remote control.

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:29.620
But hey, I got data on a new Rare Igura.

00:21:31.050 --> 00:21:32.970
Invisibility...

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:39.640
Amata!

00:21:39.640 --> 00:21:40.650
Mikono!

00:21:41.030 --> 00:21:43.090
Zessica told me everything.

00:21:43.090 --> 00:21:44.980
I guess I jumped to conclusions.

00:21:45.510 --> 00:21:46.660
I'm sorry!

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:47.780
Don't worry about it.

00:21:51.070 --> 00:21:52.410
This is the new member of our team.

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:55.220
Yes. My name is Yunoha.

00:21:55.220 --> 00:21:58.400
You're the ghost of that dead Element, right?

00:21:58.400 --> 00:21:59.460
Huh?

00:21:59.460 --> 00:22:02.520
Don't worry. I'm not scared of you anymore.

00:22:02.520 --> 00:22:04.920
Let's fight together.

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:06.580
Hold on!

00:22:06.580 --> 00:22:08.890
What are you talking about, Amata?

00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:12.700
There seems to be a misunderstanding.

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:16.260
I'm sorry, but I'm alive.

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:22.520
Yunoha Thrul is an Element student, just like you.

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:25.160
I'm so sorry!

00:22:25.910 --> 00:22:29.950
Oh, god! Let me down!

00:22:30.430 --> 00:22:32.750
Oh, Amata...

00:22:32.750 --> 00:22:34.950
He'll fly for anyone.

00:24:11.550 --> 00:24:13.130
My name's Zessica Wong!

00:24:13.450 --> 00:24:16.680
I'm pretty famous for a 17-year-old, because they say I expose way too much!

00:24:16.680 --> 00:24:18.680
Well, the depths of my cleavage may be open for all to see,

00:24:18.680 --> 00:24:21.230
but not a soul knows the depths of my heart.

00:24:21.980 --> 00:24:25.020
Next time on Aquarion Evol: Revelations.
